msgctxt "BainAncovaBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Place each hypothesis on a new line. For example:\n"
"\n"
"factorLow = factorMed = factorHigh\n"
"factorLow < factorMed < factorHigh\n"
"\n"
"where factor is the factor name and Low/Med/High are the factor level "
"names.\n"
"Read the help file for further instructions."
msgstr ""
"هر فرضیه را در یک خط جدید قرار دهید. برای مثال: factorLow = factorMed = "
"factorHigh factorLow < factorMed < factorHigh که در آن factor نام عامل و Low/"
"Med/High نام سطوح عامل هستند. برای دستورالعمل‌های بیشتر، فایل راهنما را "
"بخوانید."

